# Written into the workspace by google-github-actions/auth during CI. The
# migrate stage does `COPY . .`, so without this it is baked into a published
# image in Artifact Registry — the app stages copy only build output and were
# never affected. It is a Workload Identity config file rather than a private
# key, but it names the provider and service account and has no business in a
# layer.
gha-creds-*.json
